      "id": "E-F0-EXPORT-BOUNDARY-REVIEW",
      "kind": "inspection",
      "command_or_method": "Inspect two-prefix product-record exclusion and regression assertion delta; authenticate old bytes; reexamine scope of unchanged preservation/acceptance algorithms and unchanged technical consumers. See execution-authority-review.md.",
